Contracts (backend independent)
  functional_call(module, params, args)      -> Tensor
  grad_params(fn, params, *a, **k)           -> param-treedef grad of fn(params)
  hvp(fn, params, v, *a, **k)                -> (H @ v) for scalar fn, H = d2f/dp2
